notes.notes:
[h2]New features in patch 0.15.hf2 for The Revenants:[/h2]
[list]
[*] 6 new locations for tactical combat;
[*]  Localization into 7 languages;
[*] The mechanics of fighting groups of other survivors;
[*] 5 new random events;
[*] The Larva opponent has gained the ability to long-range attack.
[/list]

[h2]Corrections:[/h2]
[list]
[*] Fixed game departure errors in some cases of location searches in manual mode;
[*] Fixed numerous minor bugs;
[*] Fixed a number of errors in localization of random events into English.
[/list]

[h2]Balance:[/h2]
[list]
[*] The speed of the "Rat" and "Wild Dog" opponents has been significantly increased;
[*] Increased the frequency of random events in the "Road" location;
[*] Introduced random melee damage deflection for all weapons.
[/list]
